        {
          type: 'folder',
          title: 'Hobbins RefET',
          description:
            'The Hobbins Reference Evapotranspiration data is global evapotranspiration product derive from Mike Hobbins fine resolution, ETos (short crop reference ET). The original data has been rescaled to the CHIRPS resolution of 0.05&deg; for compatibility in this EWX viewer. Detailed information on the original data creation and referencing can be found here at the <a target=\"_blank\"href="https://www.esrl.noaa.gov/psd/eddi/globalrefet/"> Global Reference ET site</a>. The data can be downloaded at the <a target=\"_blank\"href="ftp://ftp.cdc.noaa.gov/Projects/RefET/global/Gen-0/fine_resolution/data_v2/"> RefET FTP site</a>. Some of the available data is preliminary and is marked, preQAQC. These data will be periodically updated as new Hobbins RefET data becomes available.<br><br>**** Please note, this dataset is experimental and open to change. ****<br><br>The Climate Hazards Center wishes to thank Mike Hobbins for his presistant efforts improving this RefET product and making it available to us.',
